{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57896","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57896","key":"SV-11402","fields":{"summary":"Tech View: dragging a pinned technician's header opens the work order where it is released","parent":{"id":"56387","key":"SV-10043","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56387","fields":{"summary":"Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10004","description":"This work item is being actively worked on at the moment by the assignee.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"In Progress","id":"10004","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"Epics track collections of related bugs, stories, and tasks. (Migrated on 31 Dec 2023 09:01 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10306?size=medium","name":"Epic","subtask":false,"avatarId":10306,"entityId":"b16adb77-4b77-44c6-9be7-926745903790","hierarchyLevel":1}}},"attachment":[],"description":"h3. What\n\nIn Tech View, dragging a pinned technician's group header opens the work order that sits where the header is released. Dragging a group header must only reorder technicians; it must never open a work order.\n\nh3. Steps\n\n# Open Work Orders and switch to Tech View.\n# Pin a technician (pin on their group header).\n# Drag that pinned technician's group header up or down, across work order rows, and release it over a work order row.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nThe pinned technician moves within the pinned area only (S9-R9), or stays put if released outside it. No work order opens. A click opens a work order only when there was no drag (S2-R8).\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v55|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S9-R9, S2-R8).\n\nh3. Actual\n\nThe work order under the pointer at release opens, as if it had been clicked.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Drag a pinned technician's header and release it over a work order row: no work order opens; the order of pinned technicians updates or stays the same.\n* Repeat with an unpinned technician's header: no work order opens.\n* A plain click on a work order row still opens it.\n\nSeen by Chris Ward on staging, 2026-10-15.","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57896/comment/78805","id":"78805","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20